  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/XVIII/208/208-3-d.htm",
  "statuteText": "208:3-d Pistols Permitted. –\n\nPistols permitted under RSA 208:3, 3-a, 3-b, and 3-c shall include .327 Federal Magnum, and any caliber .357 Magnum and greater, provided that a pistol used for taking deer under this section shall be loaded with no more than 6 rounds of ammunition at any time."
